' Nothing moves under a door's film (`ImageScene.OnUpdate`, ImageScene.cs:
' 72-82, runs only its subtitles; `World.Update` is MapScene's,
' LocationScene's and InventoryScene's): run with `preset classic ai none
' seed 3 start 0 savefile <f>` (New Sandez). Near the pub's door, a save;
' the door, 300 frames of its film, Escape to the pub, Escape out, and a
' save: between the two the place's people have moved only while he walked
' the last steps to the door (about 18 steps), not through the film's 300
' frames (the build before this moved them to new targets meanwhile).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 75,303          ' into New Sandez
wait 60
mapclick 290,300         ' near the pub's door
wait 90
save
mapclick 309,264         ' the pub: film_06
wait 300
press escape             ' the film closed: the pub
wait 2
esc                      ' out of the pub
save
quit
